{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 47, :comments ["<b>And you shall take five shekels.</b> And likewise for all generations. And if you ask: why do the Levites not redeem their firstborn born from here onward, just as the Israelite firstborn redeem their firstborn? The answer is that all Levites born are from these, but the firstborn of Israel are not born from the firstborn but from all Israelites who were not redeemed, and those born from the firstborn are not known. Therefore the Holy One, blessed be He, commanded to redeem all the firstborn born from here onward."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:03.236327910Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}